e_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance."}],"target_ref":"sha256:8c370b67aa0a6f2b705479e8d6814e78733322389d75881ba1c79f94458dfa9b/papers/long.json","target_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion."}],"to":"sha256:4c6350e9b4de8b6fa8cb1160f0ada57e4a2b797aebd0c518c88b1ace1b27878b/papers/long.md/sha256:8c370b67aa0a6f2b705479e8d6814e78733322389d75881ba1c79f94458dfa9b/papers/long.json/passages/density"},{"annotation_basis":"shared_claim_ids","derived":true,"from":"sha256:0cd16e6afa4096fccc55a516a798b7287a6570a5e77248099820f99b2079800b/papers/short.md/sha256:2ffc265585cd63413034841fe74b99bdfd311b903d8e1690214debca0c3a94c0/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","id":"shared-claims:5cd40b6bea1f5611b079f709d2e24994b90bda99b06babd968300f9035efe6e4","kind":"shared_claim","selection_relation":"outgoing","shared_claim_refs":["sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"source_field":"passages.claim_ids","source_ref":"sha256:2ffc265585cd63413034841fe74b99bdfd311b903d8e1690214debca0c3a94c0/papers/short.json","source_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92